rgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"What's the difference? I understand why we shouldn't use project metadata (it's the same for all layouts), but I don't know the difference between the window layout and the `EditorDock` layout.\r\n\r\nAs a reference, I used `ShaderEditorPlugin`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/98782b6c8c9cabe0fb7c80bc62640735ecb076d3/editor/shader/shader_editor_plugin.cpp#L255-L257\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/98782b6c8c9cabe0fb7c80bc62640735ecb076d3/editor/shader/shader_editor_plugin.cpp#L302\r\n\r\n```ini\r\n; res://.godot/editor/editor_layout.cfg\r\n\r\n; ...\r\n\r\n[ShaderEditor]\r\n\r\nopen_shaders=[]\r\nsplit_offset=316\r\nselected_shader=\"\"\r\ntext_shader_zoom_factor=1.0\r\n\r\n[ThemeEditor]\r\n\r\nsplit_offset=-470\r\n```","created_at":"2026-02-02T06:45:15Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T06:45:16Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115719#discussion_r2752799763","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115719","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2752799763"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115719#discussion_r2752799763"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115719"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2752799763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":505,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":506,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2752045766,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":21,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"h